
(7 lej-khib?) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], kab-tshiab. }, lwm-yam: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 lej-khub?) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], kab-tshiab. }, lwm-yam: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 lej-khub?) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['WRONG!']. }, lwm-yam: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], kab-tshiab. }.
(6 lej-khib?) tseeb: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['WRONG!']. }, lwm-yam: { Tawm sau-ntawv: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], kab-tshiab. }.
